# Personal Expense Tracker

A command-line Personal Expense Tracker built with Python.  
The application allows users to record income and expenses, track their balance, and analyze their spending. Transaction data is stored locally using JSON.

## Features

- Add income
- Add expenses
- Automatically generate transaction IDs
- Automatically record transaction dates
- View all transactions
- Search transactions by:
  - Category
  - Date
  - Type (Income or Expense)
- Calculate current balance
- View spending by category
- Find the highest expense
- Generate monthly summaries
- Delete transactions
- JSON-based data storage
- Input validation and exception handling

## Technologies Used

- Python
- JSON
- Python `datetime` module

## Concepts Practiced

This project was built to practice core Python concepts, including:

- Object-Oriented Programming (OOP)
- Classes and methods
- Functions
- Lists and dictionaries
- Loops and conditional statements
- File handling
- JSON data handling
- Exception handling
- User input validation

